---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Rivett · Performance marketing for operators"
  description="Fifteen years running paid acquisition. A one-operator practice for US operators, at a fraction of US agency cost. AI in the loop where it earns its place."
  fontWeights="Inter+Tight:wght@400;500;600;700"
  currentNav="home"
>
  <div class="page">
    <section class="first" style="border-top:0;padding-top:0">
      <div class="hero">
        <div>
          <div class="stamp">A practice · est. 2026 · Cape Town &amp; remote</div>
          <h1 class="display" style="margin-top:28px">
            Performance<br/>
            marketing for<br/>
            <span class="ital">operators<span style="color:var(--accent)">.</span></span>
          </h1>
          <p class="lede">
            Fifteen years running paid acquisition. Most recently as ex-growth at Somewhere.com. Now I work directly with US operators, at a fraction of US agency cost, with AI in the loop where it earns its place.
          </p>
          <div class="hero-cta">
            <a href="#contact" class="btn primary">Book a 30-min diagnostic <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
            <a href="#modules" class="btn ghost">See the work</a>
          </div>
          <div class="meta">
            <div>Principal<b>Fred Style</b></div>
            <div>Spend run<b>$100M+ managed</b></div>
            <div>Markets<b>4 continents</b></div>
            <div>Years<b>15</b></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside class="hero-r">
          <div class="availability">Taking 3 new clients · Q3 2026</div>
          <div class="row"><span class="k">M01 · Diagnostic</span><span class="v">$3,500 · 2 wks</span></div>
          <div class="row"><span class="k">M02 · Build</span><span class="v">Scoped after M01</span></div>
          <div class="row"><span class="k">M03 · Run</span><span class="v">Monthly retainer</span></div>
          <div class="row"><span class="k">Workhours</span><span class="v">SAST overlap with US ET / GMT</span></div>
          <div class="row"><span class="k">Reply window</span><span class="v">Inside 24 hours</span></div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="about">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <div class="label"><b>01</b> · Track record</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Fifteen years running acquisition. $100M+ in managed spend. Four continents.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="inherit">
        <div>
          <p class="editorial">A senior operator. <span class="em">Not an agency.</span> One person on the work, with AI doing the busywork underneath.</p>
          <p class="body">
            Fifteen years inside paid acquisition for brands across consumer, B2B and DTC. Most recently a year as ex-growth at <strong>Somewhere.com</strong>, the global recruiting platform. Before that, in-house performance leadership across four continents and roughly $100M in managed spend.
          </p>
          <p class="body" style="margin-top:18px">
            The work is the resume. Senior, by hours on the work, not by job title. <strong>One operator running your acquisition stack</strong>, the way you'd run it yourself if you had fifteen years of pattern recognition and the time to apply it.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <div class="label">By the numbers</div>
          <div class="roster" style="margin-top:14px">
            <div class="row"><span class="nm">Career</span><span class="ds">Paid acquisition, in-house and consulting</span><span class="yr">15 yrs</span></div>
            <div class="row"><span class="nm">Most recent</span><span class="ds">Ex-growth, Somewhere.com</span><span class="yr">1 yr</span></div>
            <div class="row"><span class="nm">Managed spend</span><span class="ds">Paid search, social, programmatic</span><span class="yr">$100M+</span></div>
            <div class="row"><span class="nm">Continents</span><span class="ds">USA, Africa, Europe, Asia</span><span class="yr">4</span></div>
            <div class="row"><span class="nm">Sectors</span><span class="ds">Consumer, B2B, DTC, recruiting, media</span><span class="yr">5+</span></div>
          </div>
          <p class="body" style="margin-top:32px;font-size:15px">
            Independent. Cape Town based. Available to a small number of operators per quarter.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="modules">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <div class="label"><b>02</b> · The work</div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="section-title">Three modules. Each one fixed in scope.</h2>
          <p class="lede" style="margin-top:24px">A senior operator running your acquisition stack: diagnosed, built, run. No retainer creep, no agency layer cake. You start with a paid diagnostic and decide from there.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="modules">
        <div class="module featured">
          <div class="head">
            <span class="num">M01 · Diagnostic</span>
            <span class="dur">02 wks</span>
          </div>
          <h4>I audit your acquisition stack and tell you the truth.</h4>
          <p class="desc">Two weeks. I look at your paid, organic, lifecycle, tooling, and the AI workflows you're already running or being sold. You get a written diagnosis and a prioritized fix list. Nothing fluffy.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Paid &amp; SEO performance teardown</li>
            <li>Funnel + lifecycle audit</li>
            <li>Tooling &amp; AI workflow review</li>
            <li>Prioritized 90-day fix list</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="price">
            <div class="p"><span class="cur">USD</span>3,500</div>
            <div class="term">Fixed · credited to M02</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="module">
          <div class="head">
            <span class="num">M02 · Build</span>
            <span class="dur">04-06 wks</span>
          </div>
          <h4>I build the system the diagnostic prescribed.</h4>
          <p class="desc">Paid media rebuilt where it was broken. SEO and lifecycle stood up where they weren't. AI workflows wired in where they earn their place. You get the system and the dashboard.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Paid media rebuild · GA / Meta / LinkedIn</li>
            <li>SEO foundations &amp; programmatic</li>
            <li>Lifecycle &amp; CRM activation</li>
            <li>AI workflows where they earn it</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="price">
            <div class="p" style="font-size:24px;color:var(--ink-dim)">Scoped after M01</div>
            <div class="term">Fixed-scope quote</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="module">
          <div class="head">
            <span class="num">M03 · Run</span>
            <span class="dur">monthly</span>
          </div>
          <h4>I run the system, weekly, with the dashboard live.</h4>
          <p class="desc">Optional. For operators who want a senior brain on the marketing arm of the business without hiring an in-house team. Weekly reviews, live dashboards, monthly board-grade summaries.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Weekly working sessions</li>
            <li>Live dashboard &amp; alerting</li>
            <li>Monthly board summary</li>
            <li>Cancel any month</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="price">
            <div class="p" style="font-size:24px;color:var(--ink-dim)">Scoped after M01</div>
            <div class="term">Month-to-month</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="modules-foot">M01 fee credits in full toward M02 if you continue. No long contracts. No retainer creep.</div>
    </section>

    <section id="approach">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <div class="label"><b>03</b> · Where AI fits</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">AI is a tool, not the pitch.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="ai-grid">
        <div>
          <p class="ai-pull">Agents are going to be commoditized. The valuable thing is knowing where to point them, <span class="em">and where not to.</span></p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="body">
            I use AI for the work that's mechanical: enrichment, drafting, monitoring, daily reporting, the long tail of operational busywork that bleeds an in-house marketer dry. <strong>I don't use it for the work that requires judgment</strong>: which audience to chase, which channel to fund, which message will land with a 320-person construction firm in Texas. That part stays with me.
          </p>
          <p class="body" style="margin-top:18px">
            Most agencies are now selling the busywork as the product. I'm selling the judgment, with the busywork automated underneath. Different deal.
          </p>

          <div class="twocol" style="margin-top:40px">
            <div>
              <h5 class="yes">What I automate</h5>
              <ul>
                <li>Lead enrichment &amp; routing</li>
                <li>Draft outreach &amp; sequencing</li>
                <li>Daily / weekly reporting</li>
                <li>Anomaly &amp; spend alerts</li>
                <li>Content briefs at scale</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h5 class="no">What stays human</h5>
              <ul>
                <li class="dim">Audience &amp; positioning calls</li>
                <li class="dim">Channel mix &amp; budget</li>
                <li class="dim">Creative &amp; message strategy</li>
                <li class="dim">Pricing &amp; offer design</li>
                <li class="dim">The hard conversation about why it's not working</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="why-sa" style="border-top:0;padding:0">
      <div class="geo">
        <div class="inner">
          <div>
            <div class="stamp">The deal</div>
            <h2>A senior US operator,<br/>without the <span class="em">San Francisco tax.</span></h2>
            <p class="body" style="margin-top:32px;font-size:18px">
              I work from Cape Town. That's not a quirk, it's the same philosophy <strong>Somewhere.com</strong> is built on, where I spent the past year running ex-growth: world-class senior operators don't all live in San Francisco, and Americans shouldn't have to pay San Francisco rates to work with one.
            </p>
            <p class="body" style="margin-top:18px;font-size:18px">
              You get a fifteen-year operator at a fraction of US agency cost. Same caliber. Different cost structure, by design. <strong>That's why this works.</strong>
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="compare">
            <div class="row head"><span class="lab">Senior performance lead</span><span class="lab">Annualized</span></div>
            <div class="row us"><span class="val">US agency, retainer</span><span class="val">$300-500k</span></div>
            <div class="row us"><span class="val">In-house VP marketing</span><span class="val">$220-280k</span></div>
            <div class="row us"><span class="val">Boutique consultancy</span><span class="val">$180-240k</span></div>
            <div class="row rivett"><span class="lab">Rivett · M03 retainer</span><span class="val">~⅓ of the above</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="who">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <div class="label"><b>04</b> · Who this is for</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Operators of profitable, un-glamorous businesses. Real revenue, ready to compound.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="who-grid">
        <div class="who-cell">
          <div class="tag">01</div>
          <h4>Real estate operators &amp; brokerages.</h4>
          <p>Self-storage, multifamily, brokerage, REPE. Capital raise, sphere and farm, leasing pipeline.</p>
          <div class="examples">Self-storage · Brokerage · REPE · Property mgmt</div>
        </div>
        <div class="who-cell">
          <div class="tag">02</div>
          <h4>Service businesses &amp; agencies.</h4>
          <p>Boring, profitable, growing. Construction, manufacturing, professional services, agency owners. 50-500 people, real revenue, ready to compound.</p>
          <div class="examples">Contractors · Agencies · Professional services · Wholesale</div>
        </div>
        <div class="who-cell">
          <div class="tag">03</div>
          <h4>Founders &amp; operators of mid-market companies.</h4>
          <p>50 to 500 people, profitable, ready to compound. You don't want a slick agency. You want a senior brain on the marketing arm of the business.</p>
          <div class="examples">Founder-led · PE-backed · Family-owned</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="who-foot">If you don't see yourself here exactly, <a href="#contact">email me anyway</a>. I'll tell you straight if I'm the wrong call.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="contact" style="border-top:0">
      <div class="cta-block">
        <div>
          <div class="stamp">Next step</div>
          <h2 style="margin-top:24px">Start with the<br/><span class="em">diagnostic.</span></h2>
          <p class="lede">Two weeks. $3,500, fixed. A written diagnosis of your acquisition stack and a prioritized fix list. If we keep working together, the fee credits to the build. If not, you keep the diagnosis.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="actions">
          <a href="mailto:fred@rivett.tech?subject=M01%20Diagnostic" class="btn primary">Email Fred directly <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
          <a href="mailto:fred@rivett.tech?subject=Book%20a%20call" class="btn ghost">Book 30-min call</a>
          <div class="meta">fred@rivett.tech · reply within 24 hours</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="foot">
      <div>
        <div class="wordmark">rivett<span class="dot-mark"></span></div>
        <div class="legal">A practice · est. 2026<br/>Cape Town · remote-first</div>
      </div>
      <div class="col">
        <h6>The work</h6>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="#modules">M01 · Diagnostic</a></li>
          <li><a href="#modules">M02 · Build</a></li>
          <li><a href="#modules">M03 · Run</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="col">
        <h6>About</h6>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="#about">Track record</a></li>
          <li><a href="#approach">Where AI fits</a></li>
          <li><a href="/blog">Field Notes</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="col">
        <h6>Contact</h6>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="mailto:fred@rivett.tech">fred@rivett.tech</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/fredstyle/">LinkedIn</a></li>
          <li><a href="#contact">Book diagnostic</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </div>
</Base>

<style is:global>
  .stamp{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent-deep);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
  .stamp::before{content:'';width:8px;height:8px;background:var(--accent);border-radius:50%}
  .label{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-faint)}
  .label b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:500}

  h1.display{font-family:var(--grotesk);font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(48px,7.4vw,104px);line-height:0.94;letter-spacing:-0.05em;margin:0;color:var(--ink)}
  h1.display .em{color:var(--ink)}
  h1.display .dim{color:var(--ink-faint)}
  h1.display .ital{font-family:var(--serif);font-style:italic;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:var(--ink-dim)}

  h2.section-title{font-family:var(--grotesk);font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(36px,4.6vw,60px);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-0.04em;margin:0;color:var(--ink)}
  h3.sub{font-family:var(--grotesk);font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(26px,2.6vw,34px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.03em;margin:0;color:var(--ink)}

  p.lede{font-size:19px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-dim);max-width:580px;font-weight:400;margin:0}
  p.body{font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--ink-dim);font-weight:400;margin:0;max-width:680px}
  p.body strong{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}

  section{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:120px 0}
  section.first{border-top:0;padding-top:48px}
  @media (max-width:780px){section{padding:72px 0}}

  .sec-head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:120px 1fr;gap:48px;align-items:start;margin-bottom:56px}
  @media (max-width:780px){.sec-head{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px;margin-bottom:40px}}

  .hero{padding:88px 0 24px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.25fr 1fr;gap:80px;align-items:end}
  @media (max-width:980px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:56px;padding:64px 0 0}}
  .hero .lede{margin-top:36px;max-width:560px}
  .hero .meta{margin-top:48px;padding-top:24px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:24px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-faint)}
  .hero .meta b{display:block;color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--grotesk);font-size:14px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.01em;text-transform:none;margin-top:6px}
  @media (max-width:680px){.hero .meta{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}

  .hero-r{padding:36px 36px 32px;background:var(--paper-2);border:1px solid var(--ink);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;align-self:stretch;justify-content:flex-end}
  .hero-r .row{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;padding:14px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
  .hero-r .row:first-of-type{border-top:1px solid var(--line-strong)}
  .hero-r .k{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent-deep)}
  .hero-r .v{font-family:var(--grotesk);font-size:15px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:var(--ink);text-align:right;max-width:60%}
  .hero-r .availability{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink)}
  .hero-r .availability::before{content:'';width:8px;height:8px;background:var(--accent);border-radius:50%;animation:pulse 2.4s ease-in-out infinite}
  @keyframes pulse{0%,100%{opacity:1}50%{opacity:0.4}}

  .hero-cta{margin-top:40px;display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center}
  .btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:16px 24px;border:1px solid var(--ink);text-decoration:none;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.22em;text-transform:uppercase;transition:all 0.15s}
  .btn.primary{background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper)}
  .btn.primary:hover{background:var(--accent-deep);border-color:var(--accent-deep)}
  .btn.ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--ink)}
  .btn.ghost:hover{background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper)}
  .btn .arrow{font-family:var(--grotesk);font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0;text-transform:none;font-size:14px}

  .inherit{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:64px;align-items:start}
  @media (max-width:980px){.inherit{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:40px}}
  .inherit .body{max-width:none}
  .inherit .editorial{font-family:var(--serif);font-style:italic;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(28px,3.2vw,40px);line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:-0.015em;color:var(--ink-dim);margin:0 0 28px}
  .inherit .editorial .em{color:var(--accent-deep);font-style:italic}

  .roster{margin-top:40px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
  .roster .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:120px 1fr 90px;gap:16px;padding:18px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);align-items:baseline}
  .roster .nm{font-family:var(--grotesk);font-weight:600;font-size:17px;letter-spacing:-0.015em;color:var(--ink)}
  .roster .ds{font-family:var(--grotesk);font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-dim);font-weight:400}
  .roster .yr{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-faint);text-align:right}

  .modules{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:0;border:1px solid var(--ink);background:var(--paper)}
  @media (max-width:980px){.modules{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  .module{padding:48px 40px 40px;border-right:1px solid var(--ink);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px;min-height:540px}
  .module:last-child{border-right:0}
  @media (max-width:980px){.module{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ink);min-height:auto}.module:last-child{border-bottom:0}}
  .module .head{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding-bottom:20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .module .num{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent-deep)}
  .module .dur{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-faint)}
  .module h4{font-family:var(--grotesk);font-weight:700;font-size:30px;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.05;margin:0;color:var(--ink)}
  .module .desc{font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-dim);font-weight:400;margin:0}
  .module ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:8px 0 0;font-family:var(--grotesk);font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-dim)}
  .module ul li{padding:8px 0;border-top:1px dashed var(--line);display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:baseline}
  .module ul li::before{content:'';flex-shrink:0;width:5px;height:5px;background:var(--accent);border-radius:50%;transform:translateY(-2px)}
  .module .price{margin-top:auto;padding-top:24px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:12px}
  .module .price .p{font-family:var(--grotesk);font-weight:700;font-size:32px;letter-spacing:-0.03em;color:var(--ink)}
  .module .price .p .cur{font-family:var(--mono);font-weight:400;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-faint);margin-right:4px;letter-spacing:0.05em}
  .module .price .term{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-faint);text-align:right}
  .module.featured{background:var(--paper-2)}
  .module.featured .head{border-color:var(--line-strong)}

  .modules-foot{margin-top:24px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.04em;color:var(--ink-faint);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .modules-foot::before{content:'↳';color:var(--accent-deep);font-family:var(--grotesk);font-weight:500;font-size:14px}

  .ai-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:80px;align-items:start}
  @media (max-width:980px){.ai-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:40px}}
  .ai-pull{font-family:var(--grotesk);font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(30px,3.4vw,44px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.035em;color:var(--ink);margin:0}
  .ai-pull .em{color:var(--accent-deep)}

  .twocol{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:32px;margin-top:8px}
  @media (max-width:680px){.twocol{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px}}
  .twocol h5{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent-deep);margin:0 0 16px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
  .twocol h5.no::before{content:'';width:8px;height:8px;background:var(--ink-faint);border-radius:50%}
  .twocol h5.yes::before{content:'';width:8px;height:8px;background:var(--accent);border-radius:50%}
  .twocol ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
